    <string name="onboarding_help_reset">重置引导</string>

    <string name="onboarding_help_section_bookshelf">1. 书架</string>
    <string name="onboarding_help_bookshelf_1">• 首次进入后，点击右上角 + 选择一个文件夹作为书架目录</string>
    <string name="onboarding_help_bookshelf_2">• 根目录下的每个子文件夹会被视作一本漫画</string>
    <string name="onboarding_help_bookshelf_3">• 子文件夹内的多个 PDF / EPUB / CBZ 等按名称自然排序作为章节</string>
    <string name="onboarding_help_bookshelf_4">• 长按漫画卡片可标记为收藏</string>

    <string name="onboarding_help_section_reading">2. 阅读</string>
    <string name="onboarding_help_reading_1">• 点击屏幕中央唤出/关闭菜单</string>
    <string name="onboarding_help_reading_2">• 点击屏幕左/右区域翻页（RTL 日漫模式下方向相反）</string>
    <string name="onboarding_help_reading_3">• 双指捏合可自由缩放（仅在「自由缩放」模式下）</string>
    <string name="onboarding_help_reading_4">• 平板/横屏下，菜单会自动变成左右两侧栏，方便预览中间内容</string>
    <string name="onboarding_help_reading_5">• 屏幕左边缘向右滑动可返回上一级</string>

    <string name="onboarding_help_section_mode">3. 阅读模式</string>
    <string name="onboarding_help_mode_1">• 页模式：默认翻页模式，可切换单页 / 双页 / 日漫 RTL</string>
    <string name="onboarding_help_mode_2">• 垂直滚动：适合韩式条漫、国产条漫</string>
    <string name="onboarding_help_mode_3">• 水平滚动：长条横向漫画</string>

    <string name="onboarding_help_section_image">4. 画面优化</string>
    <string name="onboarding_help_image_1">• 裁白边：扫描类漫画自动切除多余白边</string>
    <string name="onboarding_help_image_2">• 亮度 / 对比 / 伽马：调整图像观感</string>
    <string name="onboarding_help_image_3">• 黑白 / 锐化：改善老旧扫描件</string>
    <string name="onboarding_help_image_4">• 旋转 / 镜像：调整方向</string>
    <string name="onboarding_help_image_5">• 缩放适配：自由缩放 / 适合宽 / 适合屏</string>

    <string name="onboarding_help_section_progress">5. 进度管理</string>
    <string name="onboarding_help_progress_1">• 每本漫画的当前页码会自动保存，重启后恢复</string>
    <string name="onboarding_help_progress_2">• 菜单中可点击 ☆ 添加书签</string>
    <string name="onboarding_help_progress_3">• 「跳转」可输入页码直接定位</string>
    <string name="onboarding_help_progress_4">• 「缩略图」可显示所有页预览，点击跳转</string>

    <string name="onboarding_help_section_formats">6. 格式支持</string>
    <string name="onboarding_help_formats_1">• 压缩包：CBZ/ZIP、CBR/RAR、CB7/7Z、CBT/TAR</string>
    <string name="onboarding_help_formats_2">• 文档：EPUB、PDF、MOBI</string>
    <string name="onboarding_help_formats_3">• 图片文件夹：JPG / PNG / WebP / GIF / HEIC / BMP</string>

    <string name="onboarding_help_section_privacy">7. 隐私</string>
    <string name="onboarding_help_privacy_1">• 网络权限仅用于元数据刮削、WebDAV同步等可选功能</string>
    <string name="onboarding_help_privacy_2">• 默认不会上传任何阅读记录或文件</string>

    <string name="onboarding_help_section_experimental">8. 实验性功能</string>
    <string name="onboarding_help_experimental_1">• SMB / NAS 流式阅读：入口已预留，目前仅支持浏览 HTTP 文件列表，还不能直接打开漫画</string>
    <string name="onboarding_help_experimental_2">• WebDAV 同步：配置服务器后支持上传、下载与双向同步阅读进度、书签与收藏</string>

